repair_1 = "The first hf-done on f6283d97e8791ca158b0a56897c6ecc538cc3fd8 exited 1 (private /out/logs/verify-1.log): the fresh consensus commit contains a legitimate absent validator slot. The helper now validates the full slot count, canonical absent address/signature/timestamp and signed-slot validator order, retains the signed block_id_flag assertion, and supplies actual votes to the unchanged production quorum verifier; an additional refusal proves absent slots supply no voting power."
